---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Situation Assessment | Agent Kammer" description="Figure out your situation. Tell us what changed, and we send back a personal profile of where you stand.">
  <figure class="sa-banner">
    <img src="/images/assessment-banner.jpg" width="2000" height="1333" alt="A Manhattan tower with a lit rooftop frame at dusk, the downtown skyline beyond" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
  </figure>
  <section class="sa">
    <div class="col">
      <div class="sa-head">
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="platIcon" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
              <stop offset="0" stop-color="#868D94" />
              <stop offset=".3" stop-color="#AEB3B9" />
              <stop offset=".5" stop-color="#DEE1E4" />
              <stop offset=".7" stop-color="#AEB3B9" />
              <stop offset="1" stop-color="#868D94" />
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
          <path stroke="url(#platIcon)" d="M4 5h6m3 0h7m-4 4v6M10 2v6m2 8v6m4-10h4M4 12h9m-1 7h8M4 19h5" />
        </svg>
        <h1>Figure out your situation.</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="lede">The Situation Assessment is the diagnostic that gets you to a decision. Tell us what changed, and we send back a personal profile of where you stand.</p>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><b>01</b>What changed. The life event, the pressure, and the decision on the table.</li>
        <li><b>02</b>Where you stand. We read the situation before we recommend a next step.</li>
        <li><b>03</b>Your next step. A profile you can act on, with the next step named.</li>
      </ol>
      <section class="stamp" aria-labelledby="sa-ask">
        <h2 id="sa-ask">Tell us what changed.</h2>
        <form method="post" action="/api/contact">
          <input type="hidden" name="form" value="Situation Assessment" />
          <label>Name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required /></label>
          <label>Email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required /></label>
          <label class="full">What changed<textarea name="changed" rows="3"></textarea></label>
          <button class="go" type="submit">Request a Situation Assessment</button>
        </form>
      </section>
      <p class="small">General information, not legal, tax or financial advice.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<script is:inline>
  // Arriving with context: fill in what changed, so nobody retypes it. The context itself travels
  // in hidden fields, added by the site-wide script in the layout.
  (function () {
    var q = new URLSearchParams(location.search);
    var sit = q.get("situation"), dec = q.get("decision");
    var ta = document.querySelector('form textarea[name="changed"]');
    var lead = [sit, dec].filter(Boolean).join(" · ");
    if (ta && lead && !ta.value) ta.value = lead + ": ";
  })();
</script>

<style>
  .sa-banner { margin: 0; line-height: 0; background: var(--stone-blue); }
  .sa-banner img { display: block; width: 100%; height: clamp(220px, 30vw, 440px); object-fit: cover; object-position: center 42%; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .sa-banner img { height: 180px; } }
  .sa { background: var(--stone-blue); color: var(--ivory); padding: clamp(56px, 8vw, 96px) 0; }
  .col { box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 clamp(16px, 6vw, 72px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; text-align: left; }  .sa-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 22px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .icon { display: block; flex: 0 0 auto; width: 56px; height: 56px; }
  h1 { margin: 0; font: 500 clamp(40px, 5.2vw, 64px)/1 var(--serif); color: var(--ivory); white-space: nowrap; }
  .lede { margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--ivory); max-width: 56ch; }
  .steps { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .steps li { padding: 14px 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--ivory); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(184, 187, 192, 0.35); }
  .steps li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .steps b { font: 600 13px/1 var(--sans); letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--champagne); margin-right: 14px; }
  .stamp { box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; padding: 72px 64px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F7F8F9, #DDE0E4); border: 1px solid #8E949B; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 12px #E9EBEE, inset 0 0 0 13px #9AA0A7, 0 18px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; color: var(--charcoal); }
  .stamp h2 { margin: 0; font: 500 38px/1.08 var(--serif); color: var(--stone-blue); }
  form { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px 18px; }
  label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font: 600 12px/1.4 var(--sans); letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #4A5058; }
  label.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  input, textarea { font: 400 15px/1.4 var(--sans); padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid #8E949B; background: #fff; color: var(--charcoal); border-radius: 0; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .go { grid-column: 1 / -1; justify-self: start; border: 0; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; height: 52px; padding: 0 28px; background: var(--stone-blue); color: var(--ivory); font: 500 14px/1 var(--sans); }
  .go:hover { opacity: 0.88; }
  .small { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #E4E6E9; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .stamp { padding: 44px 22px; } .icon { width: 44px; height: 44px; } form { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } h1 { white-space: normal; } }
</style>
